::recipe
conversion stage: initial

name: Pavlova
source: https://publicdomainrecipes.com/pavlova/
source author: u/Idzuna
source license: Public domain (Unlicense)
units: mixed
category: dessert
tags: meringue, pavlova
dietary: vegetarian
serves: 6-8
active time: ~20m
total time: ~1h15m + cooling
image: pavlova.webp

::ingredients

(egg white) 2
(sugar; caster) 1 1/2 cups
(salt) 1/2tsp
(vinegar, white) 1tsp
(cornflour) 1tsp
(water, boiling) 4tbsp
(whipped cream, optional, for serving) as desired
(fresh fruit, optional, for serving) as desired
(ice cream, optional, for serving) as desired

::equipment

(oven)
(beater)
(baking tray)
(baking paper)

::instructions

{meringue} =
    (egg white) +
    (sugar; caster) +
    (salt) +
    (vinegar, white) +
    (cornflour) +
    (water, boiling)

{meringue} <beat, until smooth, stiff and shiny>
    <beat, ~12m, until soft peaks form>
    <place, baking paper on tray>

(oven) <heat, 180c / 350-360f>

{pavlova} <bake, 180c, 10m>
    <bake, 150c / 300f, 45m>
    <cool, oven turned off>

Optional [
    {pavlova} + (whipped cream) + (fresh fruit) + (ice cream)
        <serve with>
]

# The source ingredient list suggests whipped cream and fresh fruit, while the final
# source instruction mentions fruit salad and ice cream. Both serving ideas are retained.
